Carafe: a cursor that is not clipped stays on the program's screen, as on Windows. When the screen follows a
smaller game window it is shown in the middle of the console's with black bars; the server let the cursor onto
them, outside the program's screen, where a click landed on the window's frame and a right click opened its
system menu.
LGPL-2.1-or-later, as the file it changes.

